WC-BUG-001
PFA of evidace 

Title: Delivery slot options are displayed without selectable controls
Module: Checkout
Severity: Medium
priority: High

Precondition
Buyer buyer1 is logged in and has a valid cart with net value ₹2,318.40.

Steps to reproduce
1. Open the Cart page.
2. Click Proceed to checkout.
3. Select a delivery date.
4. Click Show slots.
5. Inspect the delivery-slot options.
Expected result
Available delivery slots should have selectable radio buttons. Unavailable slots should be disabled with the reason displayed.
Actual result
The delivery-slot timings appear, but no selectable radio buttons are visible. The buyer cannot choose a delivery slot.
Business impact
The buyer may be unable to complete checkout and place an order.

